{"content":"💡 **SUGGESTION: track the template mirror as a follow-up ticket**

The PR notes (correctly) leave `workflows/ai-teammate.yml.template` untouched — its consumer-repo copies keep the un-deduped event path, so every consumer repo still burns duplicate teammate runs on assign-while-labels-change, and the template's run titles already carry the leg so the pure module would slot in directly. Please file a linked follow-up ticket so this deferred scope doesn't evaporate; a one-line mention in the module header (`DEFAULT_WORKFLOW_FILE` consumers) would also help the next reader.
